    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9555bce655809035",
      "translationZh": "我用 Claude Code 帮忙编写了这条流水线——先用 Gemma4 将一个想法变成短篇故事，再用运行在 NVIDIA 3080 上的 IndexTTS 2.5，取用 LibreVox 和 VTCK 的声音，并将它们固定为各个角色的声音。它使用 Whisper 对输出的音频片段进行质量控制，根据 Whisper 转写的输出是否匹配，给出 0-1 的评分。它还编写了一些语气分析工具，不过效果不太好。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d3baf542f93f7ce6",
      "translationZh": "设置句子的语速和情绪",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "408f8df28e882499",
      "translationZh": "使用 (200ms) 这样的标记，在词语之间插入停顿（ffmpeg）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "02c482a4469aa803",
      "translationZh": "a) 将停顿位置调整 +/- 1 ms，因为很多停顿不知怎么会落在词语内部，而不是词语之间",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "51fe43e8b6daf985",
      "translationZh": "在句子之间插入停顿",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "58870da772d5c5ae",
      "translationZh": "针对每个词语／每个短语的情绪和语速进行精细调整",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e51b2c87f49a9011",
      "translationZh": "选取一次特别好的生成结果，将其用作参考",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "89c4e7ec3bbde477",
      "translationZh": "在整章和整本书的范围内重新分配角色声音",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f7b603ad86714fe1",
      "translationZh": "将所有句子拼接起来，播放整个章节",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "75d6ddf3de7a32b2",
      "translationZh": "下载制作完成的章节",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "6980a41e0009084b",
      "translationZh": "为某个句子添加滤镜（混响、闷音、电话音效）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "bc1821562f0811a2",
      "translationZh": "将滤镜固化到角色中，使其成为角色的一部分。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3dd6884b421e2e71",
      "translationZh": "我一开始用的是 kokoro，但我想要接近真人的效果。我先让 Claude 为我制作了一个受 LaTeX 启发的工具，让我能在书籍/脚本内部修改 Index TTS 的设置，但这变得太难用了，所以我又让它做了一个网页界面。我因为用得不顺心，不断添加功能。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9fdb6fb9fd64b93a",
      "translationZh": "我有一个独立的智能体，正在分析各种 librevox 有声书的音频，这些书也收录在 project gutenberg 中，用来学习语气分析的标准。目标是让一个智能体不断在 IndexTTS 上重新生成录音版本，对停顿、发音和语气进行质量检查，并在完成后把最终的有声书发给我，从而一步实现从想法 -> 接近真人的有声书（或者至少听起来舒服，而且富有表现力）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1e42a9cdef8e8d6d",
      "translationZh": "除了 Claude 帮忙编写代码之外，实际使用的模型都是自行托管的。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "36036a43b082b0b2",
      "translationZh": "这里是语音编辑的近距离展示：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6c90b9adf39d55d1",
      "translationZh": "我震惊了，就算用了 ultra elevenreader，居然也不能使用多种声音？？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
